{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And the field</b> — twice in the Masorah; one is this, and the other is ושדי תרומות, which is what we say in Arakhin: 'ושדה מגרש עריהם לא ימכר' — meaning, it shall not be changed. And likewise שדי תרומות shall not be changed, as written: אל טל ואל מטר."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The verse citation אל טל ואל מטר (2 Samuel 1:21) is unaddressed in the source; the allusion turns on the shared root שוה/שנה linking 'shall not be changed' across both verses."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:34.596764112Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}